<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O let us rejoice in the Lord evermore,</l><l>When the darts of the tempter are flying,</l><l>For Satan still dreads, as he oft did of yore,</l><l>Our singing much more than our sighing.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O let us rejoice in the Lord evermore,</l><l>When sickness upon us is stealing,</l><l>No cordial like gladness our strength can restore,</l><l>For joy is the fountain of healing.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
